{
  "description": "Photos shown when hovering a carrier or labware on the deck view. The first entry whose regex `match` finds the labware's type (VENUS type or PyLabRobot factory name, case-insensitive) and whose `kind` (if given) matches is used. Photos are freely licensed ones from Wikimedia Commons, linked rather than copied (`credit` and `license` are shown under them); they show the kind of labware, not necessarily the exact product. `product_page` is the manufacturer's or distributor's page for the exact item, where one is known. Manufacturer sites (hamiltoncompany.com) refuse automated fetches, so their own photos are not embedded.",
